{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_05_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_05","title":"冬靈輓歌","storyCode":"TW-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"92cb3b2b9ed9bd1d26acf48f1c4d9356bc41de8782a9f04a457257e0fc1bb208","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 5下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"快！這邊走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝、謝謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩！你帶著平民先走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這群暴徒......他們在無差別攻擊街道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！我們好不容易才搶下這玩意，你倒是射準一點啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！要操縱這玩意兒哪有那麼簡單！得虧我以前在音樂學院學習過——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"哪門子學院！？喂，憲兵！不要輕舉妄動，我們有人質的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"人質在哪兒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"*萊塔尼亞粗口*！街上在跑的不都是嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉小姐！不能讓他們繼續破壞下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近的房屋都是木質結構，這樣下去整片街道都會化為火海——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火！快滅火！其他人趕緊離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"還有很多來不及撤離的平民，我們得幫他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不是完全沒法靠近嗎——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，這火力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉小姐！麻煩你照顧傷患！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑固的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些冬靈人！感染者！蛀蟲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑固的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要燒了我的家！為什麼！明明是我們養著你們的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"小心頭頂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑固的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑固的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃，塔佳娜？你、你還好嗎！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......我還好，他們控制不住那些自律施術單元，這裡很危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑固的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起反抗！把他們趕出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"現在——還不是時候——！呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑固的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腳——！好、好吧，我聽你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（腳踝的刺痛......是骨折了嗎？真糟糕......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（得快點和其他人會合......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你這，貴族的爪牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......全部撤離了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林長官，受傷的人很多，這裡人手不夠......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生們，聽這位沃爾珀小姐的話，沒受傷的年輕人也都去幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果亞葉姐姐在的話......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......她們沒有回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！亞葉和塔佳娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"她們、她們好像還在十二音街道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——我剛才問的不是“全部撤離”嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！對、對不起！但是，亞葉和塔佳娜應該不會有事的，他們救下了那麼多人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"叛亂者搶佔了城防設施，沒有正規武裝力量的她們怎麼才能沒事——咳咳，咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳，找幾個身強力壯的，和我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們有火力優勢，說不定已經有了人質，我們不應該再去刺激他們了，我們應該等著談判的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"機會！等著敵人給我們機會！你上過戰場嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但他的擔憂不無道理。大裂谷留下的活性源石極有可能殘留在沃倫姆德的地基內，任由他們破壞，後果不堪設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你們從哪裡進來的！無關人士趕緊離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有憲兵隊的我們倒更像無關人士......我見過你一面，羅德島的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝理解，斷崖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......簡單的現場判斷，如果他們繼續用那種裝置轟炸街道，十分鐘到半小時沃倫姆德就會擱淺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"最好的處理方法是切斷這片街道與城區的連結，但沃倫姆德不比移動城邦，街道缺乏自主移動的動力源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"其實拖拉機可以做得到......前提是，街道上沒有那麼多叛軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"武裝介入城鎮事務需要申請手續嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"也請二位......務必救出塔佳娜和亞葉小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林長官——這裡還需要——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......麗薩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是灰喉前輩？這位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員斷崖，天災信使萊恩哈特的護衛，他本人有別的任務，我就被拖來這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩，安托和亞葉呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐還在裡面！安托......安托姐姐，那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不用勉強，我明白了，只是確認一下......一會再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚嗚......有、有羅德島的前輩們來幫忙真是太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——不、不行，現在還不能鬆懈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我會照顧好傷患的，請一定要把亞葉姐姐救回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼小的孩子......也是幹員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭比麗薩大不了幾歲，別忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"這場營救完全在計畫之外，沒有任何防護設備，你沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——真意外，傳聞中的灰喉小姐並不是個能熱情地迎接源石的人，我還擔心過來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是不想慘劇發生太多次，救人要緊，閒話少說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，怎麼還有人敢衝進來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武裝的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩個人動作好快！快、快解決他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"有不少本地人，沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"儘量避開要害，動手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["斷崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["？？？","灰喉"]}]}
